      equipment: 'Standard 52-card deck.',
      dealing: 'All 52 cards dealt one at a time clockwise; each player receives 13. After the deal, each player passes three cards face-down in a rotating cycle: first hand pass left, second hand pass right, third hand pass across, fourth hand no pass, then repeat.',
