    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Legal',
        medium: null,
        hard: null,
      },
      considerations: [
        "Avoid scoring penalty points. Hearts count 1 each, Queen of Spades 13; Jack of Diamonds is a bonus (minus 10). Whoever captures the Ten of Clubs doubles their score for that hand. After the pass, players may turbo-charge one of four special cards (Ace of Hearts, Queen of Spades, Jack of Diamonds, Ten of Clubs), which multiplies that card's effect. The player with the lowest total when someone reaches 100 wins.",
        "Deal and pass as in standard Hearts: all 52 cards dealt one at a time (13 each); each player passes three cards in a rotating cycle (left, right, across, no pass). After the pass, each player may place one of the four special cards face up in front of them (turbo-charge). The holder of the 2 of clubs leads it to the first trick. Players must follow suit if possible; highest card of the suit led wins the trick. Hearts may not be led until a heart has been played to a previous trick (hearts broken) or the leader holds only hearts. A turbo-charged card may not be played the first time that suit is led. Turbo-charged Queen of Spades or Jack of Diamonds doubles that card's value; turbo-charged Ace of Hearts doubles all hearts for that hand; turbo-charged Ten of Clubs quadruples the hand score for the player who captures it. Shooting the moon: capture all penalty cards to deduct 26 from your score or add 26 to everyone else's.",
        'Turbo',
      ],
    },
